untime":"63 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Episodio 3","overview":"Manager Kim reconnects with Sung Han-soo and Park Jin-cheol — his fellow dad friends (and former secret agents) — on his search for Min-ji.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v8pPQuIbicSgqm2xWW20LZaTQk5.jpg","released":"2026-07-03T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"63 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4","overview":"Manager Kim's risky actions put him on the radar of enemies past and present. When danger strikes, Han-soo and Jin-cheol step up to help save the day.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2yGGXfQmvcHlxktR17CowgcxVyp.jpg","released":"2026-07-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"Manager Kim trades blows with the enemy agent chasing him — only to realize he is an old friend. Meanwhile, Min-ji attempts an escape of her own.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eMUfMt3PczKcEuHDczeC1RwXcZz.jpg","released":"2026-07-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"68 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6","overview":"Min-ji finds herself in a dire situation — until special agent Jung Sang-a shows up. The Special Missions Directorate tries to lure out Manager Kim.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5nn1Dnb4udjJdnNcYNXM8CeFdsN.jpg","released":"2026-07-11T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"68 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Episodio 7","overview":"Manager Kim and Min-ji finally reunite, but the path to safety is far from smooth. Later, Manager Kim is forced to make a difficult decision.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/50iNTwCz358iEgJW7dZtugaQ8eA.jpg","released":"2026-07-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Episodio 8","overview":"Manager Kim is captured and tortured — until the Special Missions Directorate steps in with a final mission. Ju Gang-chan makes a plan to get revenge.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s0NeAeh5x74Gzja767ksNbzh3sz.jpg","released":"2026-07-18T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"68 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Episodio 9","overview":"With Manager Kim's mission a failure, the three agent dads team up with Sang-a to fight their way out — but Gang-chan has another trick up his sleeve.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yr9ZDaEz7bNSCFycTZBWftCjL2h.jpg","released":"2026-07-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Episodio 10","overview":"Pushed to the brink by Gang-chan, Manager Kim must now make a crucial choice with Han-soo and Jin-cheol. Will Manager Kim be able to keep Min-ji safe?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ySFDgVK2lKXYkFi4TuORq45TmmF.jpg","released":"2026-07-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"73 min"},{"id":"tt42127457:0:1","season":0,"episode":1,"title":"Report: The Resurrection of a Legend","released":"2026-06-12T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt42127457:0:2","season":0,"episode":2,"title":"The Universe Part 1","released":"2026-07-31T12:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"tt42127457:0:3","season":0,"episode":3,"title":"The Universe Part 2","released":"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z"}]}}